	(text_box "TPS923 chip is a series LED boost converter. \nRecommended to run between 10kHz-25kHz via PWM_LED for brightness control.\nReturn path for LEDs is toggled via COLOR_SEL for warm/cool selection.\nFeedback current is ~14mA tuned via R37. Reference datasheet to change as needed.\nLED_MONIT is analog signal that references 0-24.5V output on LED voltage. (ADC range from 0 to ~30V)\nInternal OVP should cut out at ~24V, but software protection should kick in and disable LED_ACTIVATE at safe voltage above known forward voltage (15V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 308.61 0)
		(size 119.38 15.875)
